{"unit_id":"tag:08WW:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在本小节中，始终固定环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>。如第<REF_0001>节所述，我们可以用余单纯（cosimplicial）代数（algebras）的语言讨论模（modules）的下降（descent）数据（data），但在本小节中我们倾向于采用更具体的术语。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n对于<MATH_0002>，令<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>重张量积（tensor product），其中各因子为<MATH_0005>，张量在<MATH_0006>上取。按公式定义环（ring）同态（homomorphisms）<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>：\n<MATH_0010>\n换言之，上指标（upper index）表示来源环（ring），下指标（lower index）表示插入因子（factors）1的位置。（此记号（notation）与第<REF_0002>节引入的记号（notation）相容。）\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n回顾<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>准确地说，这里的<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的逆（inverse），后者来自定义<REF_0003>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>定义<REF_0004>：对于<MATH_0013>，<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下降（descent）数据（datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是<MATH_0014>上相对于<MATH_0015>的同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0016>\n，它是<MATH_0017>模（modules）的同构，并满足<TEXTITOPEN_0002>上闭链条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0018>\n令<MATH_0019>为<MATH_0020>模（modules）的范畴（category），其中每个模配备相对于<MATH_0021>的下降（descent）数据（data）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n例如，对于<MATH_0022>，选取同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0023>，将<MATH_0024>和<MATH_0025>自然地等同于<MATH_0026>，便得到下降（descent）数据（datum）。特别地，这一构造定义了函子（functor）<MATH_0027>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"upper index","target_term":"上指标"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"lower index","target_term":"下指标"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"因子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上闭链条件"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"固定的环映射，待决"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯","context":"余单纯代数结构，待决"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"余单纯代数，待决"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"配备下降数据的模，待决"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"模的下降，待决"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据","context":"下降数据复数形式，待决"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"一份下降数据，待决"},{"source_term":"tensor product","target_term":"张量积","context":"重复张量积，待决"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"来源环，待决"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态","context":"公式定义的环同态，待决"},{"source_term":"upper index","target_term":"上指标","context":"同态的来源指标，待决"},{"source_term":"lower index","target_term":"下指标","context":"插入位置指标，待决"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"因子","context":"插入的单位因子，待决"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号","context":"两处指标记号，待决"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"同构的逆，待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"下降数据中的同构，待决"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上闭链条件","context":"下降数据的条件，待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"下降数据范畴，待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"基扩张构造，待决"}],"notes":["remark：原文上闭链公式的 delta_2^0 与前述同态的上下指标存在疑点；保护公式原字节保留，不修公式。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08WY:statement","translation":"函子（functor）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>沿<MATH_0002>的基扩张（base extension along）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。称<MATH_0003>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>模的下降态射（descent morphism for modules）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若<MATH_0004>完全忠实（fully faithful）。称<MATH_0005>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>模的有效下降态射（effective descent morphism for modules）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，若<MATH_0006>是范畴等价（equivalence of categories）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"base extension along","target_term":"基扩张"},{"source_term":"descent morphism for modules","target_term":"模的下降态射"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"完全忠实"},{"source_term":"effective descent morphism for modules","target_term":"模的有效下降态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"基扩张函子，待决"},{"source_term":"base extension along","target_term":"基扩张","context":"沿环映射的构造，待决"},{"source_term":"descent morphism for modules","target_term":"模的下降态射","context":"定义的下降性质，待决"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"完全忠实","context":"函子的性质，待决"},{"source_term":"effective descent morphism for modules","target_term":"模的有效下降态射","context":"有效下降定义，待决"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"有效下降的条件，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08WW:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们的目标是证明：当<MATH_0001>普遍（universally）单射（injective）时，可以利用<MATH_0002>确定<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中的位置。这一过程关键地用到一些等化子（equalizer）图表（diagrams）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换下的性质，待决"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"环映射单射，待决"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"下降中的极限，待决"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图表","context":"等化子图表，待决"}],"notes":[]}
