{"unit_id":"tag:08X5:statement","translation":"定义函子（functor）<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0001><TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0002>如下：取<MATH_0003>为一个<MATH_0004>子模（submodule），它包含在<MATH_0005>中，使得图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0006>\n成为等化子（equalizer）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"submodule","target_term":"子模"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"下降数据的推前函子，待决"},{"source_term":"submodule","target_term":"子模","context":"等化子给出的子模，待决"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"定义中的图表，待决"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"推前的定义，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08X7:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>和注记<REF_0002>，映射（map）<MATH_0001>可以关于<MATH_0002>函子性地（functorially）分裂（split）。这给出交换图表（commutative diagram）中的上部竖直箭头（vertical arrows）\n<MATH_0003>\n，其中沿各列的复合（compositions）是恒等态射（identity morphisms）。第二行是余等化子（coequalizer）图表（diagram）（<REF_0003>）；这产生了虚线箭头（dashed arrow）。从右上方的方块（square）得到辅助态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>，它们蕴含第一行是分裂（split）余等化子（coequalizer）图表（diagram）。由注记<REF_0004>，可与<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>内部作张量运算（tensor），得到分裂（split）余等化子（coequalizer）图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n。由引理<REF_0005>，得出（<REF_0006>）也必为等化子（equalizer）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"functorially","target_term":"函子性地"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图表"},{"source_term":"vertical arrows","target_term":"竖直箭头"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"identity morphisms","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"dashed arrow","target_term":"虚线箭头"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"tensor","target_term":"张量运算"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"函子性分裂的映射，待决"},{"source_term":"functorially","target_term":"函子性地","context":"分裂的自然性，待决"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂","context":"余等化子的分裂，待决"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图表","context":"证明中图表，待决"},{"source_term":"vertical arrows","target_term":"竖直箭头","context":"上部箭头，待决"},{"source_term":"compositions","tar