{"unit_id":"tag:08XA:proof","translation":"显然，(b)蕴含(a)。现在验证(a)蕴含(c)。若<MATH_0001>并非普遍（universally）单射（injective），则可找到<MATH_0002>，使映射（map）<MATH_0003>具有非平凡（nontrivial）的核（kernel）<MATH_0004>。自然投影（natural projection）<MATH_0005>不是同构（isomorphism），但它在<MATH_0006>中的像（image）是同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0007>并非完全忠实（fully faithful）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n最后验证(c)蕴含(b)。由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，对于<MATH_0008>，自然映射（map）<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>模（modules）的同构（isomorphism）。对于<MATH_0011>，我们要证明<MATH_0012>是同构（isomorphism）。由伴随（adjunction），复合（composition）<MATH_0013>是恒等（identity），而上述结论表明第二个箭头（arrow）是同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0014>是同构（isomorphism）。由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0003>，得出<MATH_0015>是同构（isomorphism）。因而<MATH_0016>和<MATH_0017>是拟逆（quasi-inverse）函子（functors），这就证明了断言。\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"nontrivial","target_term":"非平凡"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"natural projection","target_term":"自然投影"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"完全忠实"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"自然映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"universally","target_te